---
const metrics = [
  {
    value: "+248%",
    label: "Más prospectos",
  },
  {
    value: "9.8%",
    label: "Tasa de conversión",
  },
  {
    value: "-72%",
    label: "Tiempo de respuesta",
  },
];

const features = [
  "Sitio web profesional",
  "Página de captación",
  "Formulario conectado",
  "Agenda de citas",
  "Seguimiento por WhatsApp",
];
---

<section id="resultados" class="relative py-20">
  <div
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1480px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 2xl:max-w-[1600px]"
  >
    <div class="mb-12 max-w-3xl">
      <div
        class="mb-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-blue-300"
      >
        Proyecto destacado
      </div>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
      >
        Una estructura digital pensada para
        <span
          class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-blue-500 to-cyan-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
        >
          generar oportunidades
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
        Ejemplo conceptual de cómo una página bien estructurada puede combinar
        presencia profesional, captación, agenda e integraciones para mejorar el
        flujo comercial de un negocio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.4fr_0.7fr]">
      <article
        class="rounded-3xl border border-blue-400/20 bg-[#061126]/70 p-7 shadow-[0_0_70px_rgba(37,99,235,0.13)] backdrop-blur-xl"
      >
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-blue-300">
          Caso conceptual
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">
          Sistema digital para negocio de servicios
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Se diseñó una experiencia enfocada en explicar la oferta, transmitir
          confianza, captar datos del prospecto y facilitar el seguimiento
          comercial.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 grid gap-4">
          {
            features.map((feature) => (
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300">
                  ✓
                </span>
                {feature}
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>

        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="mt-8 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(37,99,235,0.35)] transition hover:bg-blue-500"
        >
          Quiero algo similar
          <span class="ml-2">→</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article
        class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-blue-400/20 bg-[#061126]/70 p-4 shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(37,99,235,0.16)] backdrop-blur-xl"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/12 via-transparent to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-[#030B1A] p-4"
        >
          <div
            class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="hidden gap-5 text-xs text-slate-500 sm:flex">
              <span>Inicio</span>
              <span>Servicios</span>
              <span>Agenda</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.7fr]">
            <div
              class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-400/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.06] to-blue-500/[0.08] p-7"
            >
              <p
                class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-300"
              >
                Página de captación
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-white">
                Tu negocio visible, claro y listo para convertir.
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
                Una estructura diseñada para que el visitante entienda tu valor,
                confíe en tu negocio y tome acción.
              </p>

              <div
                class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >
                Agendar diagnóstico
              </div>

              <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
                <div
                  class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4"
                >
                  <p class="text-2xl font-black text-blue-300">24/7</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">Captación activa</p>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4"
                >
                  <p class="text-2xl font-black text-white">3s</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">Mensaje claro</p>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4"
                >
                  <p class="text-2xl font-black text-blue-300">CRM</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">Seguimiento</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div
                class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5"
              >
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Agenda tu cita</p>

                <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
                  <div class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div class="h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-600"></div>
                </div>

                <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
                  Formulario conectado a WhatsApp o CRM.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div
                class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5"
              >
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Seguimiento</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black text-blue-300">Automático</p>

                <div
                  class="mt-4 h-20 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600/30 to-cyan-400/10"
                >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="grid gap-6">
        {
          metrics.map((metric) => (
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-blue-400/20 bg-[#061126]/70 p-6 shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(37,99,235,0.10)] backdrop-blur-xl">
              <p class="text-4xl font-black text-blue-300">{metric.value}</p>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
                {metric.label}
              </p>

              <div class="mt-5 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600/30 via-blue-400/10 to-transparent" />
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
